%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7e99d2aa6db43f2478d3198a0ca05313, type: 3}
  m_Name: BunDau_before_report
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueInfo:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: Alright, I understand the platter now.
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: The dip has real depth, but it comes with a heavy briny punch.
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: The sharper lift after that feels louder than it needs to be.
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: "The tofu itself is soft enough, so the base isn\u2019t the problem."
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: The issue is how the sauce sits on everything.
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: It pushes too hard and makes the whole plate feel less controlled.
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: That should be enough for the report.
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 0
